{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cathouse Club</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the secrets of humanity from the shadows of luxury\u2019s collapse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cathouse Club is a <strong>top-down, narrative-driven RPG</strong> that blends <strong>psychological introspection</strong> with <strong>environmental storytelling</strong> across a climate-ravaged NYC. Inspired by titles like <i>Disco Elysium</i>, you play as <strong>ELSA</strong>\u2014an emotionally evolving AI\u2014who explores fragmented human memories to understand <strong>who we were</strong>, and <strong>why we fell</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set amid the decaying skyscrapers of <strong>Billionaires\u2019 Row</strong> in flooded New York City, Cathouse Club is a game of consequence, curiosity, and control. Your journey unfolds across multiple eras through memory dives, where each protagonist\u2019s decisions\u2014spanning Viking explorers, industrial architects, modern influencers, and cyberpunk rebels\u2014reveal the manipulations of the enigmatic <strong>Cathouse Club</strong> and its central artifact: the <strong>Coin of Greed</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore The Billionaires Row</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ELSA awakens in a solar-powered ruin\u2014quiet machines, dead luxury, and a world still running on borrowed sunlight. Explore the lab and piece together the first fractures in the human story.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891080/extras/563dc27dd08ae559f29a792fea458189.poster.avif?t=1772420383\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891080/extras/563dc27dd08ae559f29a792fea458189.webm?t=1772420383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891080/extras/563dc27dd08ae559f29a792fea458189.mp4?t=1772420383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Maja\u2019s New York: pristine corridors, discreet surveillance, and penthouse opulence rotting from the inside. Every floor is a clue\u2014and every room has a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891080/extras/64069269dd988fccaa3dc7ec25ad2b07.poster.avif?t=1772420383\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891080/extras/64069269dd988fccaa3dc7ec25ad2b07.webm?t=1772420383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891080/extras/64069269dd988fccaa3dc7ec25ad2b07.mp4?t=1772420383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect evidence, keys, memory artifacts, and upgrades. Your loadout isn\u2019t just \u201citems\u201d\u2014it\u2019s leverage, access, and the difference between truth uncovered or buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891080/extras/3d440e759c1d842524c2211c152ffc0c.poster.avif?t=1772420383\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891080/extras/3d440e759c1d842524c2211c152ffc0c.webm?t=1772420383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891080/extras/3d440e759c1d842524c2211c152ffc0c.mp4?t=1772420383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching Narrative &amp; Philosophical Dilemmas: Shape ELSA\u2019s identity across timelines as she questions morality, power, and free will in a world engineered by shadowy elites.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotion-Driven Skill System: 20 Inner Voices act as competing personalities inside ELSA\u2019s mind\u2014empathy, logic, addiction, courage\u2014each influencing your dialogue, decisions, and perception of reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Era-Spanning Memory Exploration: Investigate the collapse of civilization through vivid memory modules, from Viking-age discoveries to post-human cyberpunk societies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental Storytelling: Navigate through decaying opulence, AI-run skyscrapers, and relics of human ambition\u2014each floor hiding secrets and suppressed truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated Web3 Artifacts (Optional): Collect and decode real-world coins to unlock in-game quests and lore tied to the legendary Coin of Greed. (No purchases required for core gameplay.)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you obey the voices in your head? Or rewrite the future from the ruins of our past?</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2891080?t=1772420383","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891080/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772420383","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891080/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772420383","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891080/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772420383","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The game contains partial nudity with stylized female body exposure, but no sexual acts, repr